      ":question/math-academy-id": "q-58220",
      ":question/problem": "Donald records the amount of one-third liter bottles of orange juice his family drinks over a $4$-week period. The table below shows his results.\n\n| Week | Number of Bottles |\n| --- | ---: |\n| $1$ | $18$ |\n| $2$ | $19$ |\n| $3$ | $20$ |\n| $4$ | $19$ |\n\nGiven that each cross represents a different week, what line plot shows the frequency of whole liters of orange juice his family drank?"
    }
